# CI/CD & Release

## Required CI checks
- ✅ `dart format --set-exit-if-changed .`
- ✅ `dart analyze`
- ✅ `flutter test`
- ✅ Build per flavor (at least dev + prod)

## Release hygiene
- ✅ Release checklist includes:
  - version bump
  - changelog update
  - smoke test critical flows
  - verify crash reporting enabled
  - verify env points to correct backend

## Signing
- ✅ Keep signing keys in CI secrets or secure vault
- ✅ Never store keystores in repo

## NEVER
- ❌ Merge code that fails analyze/tests
- ❌ Ship without confirming correct flavor configuration
